# Adversarial Verification Harness

**Default: work freely.** Full harness is **opt-in** — activate only on explicit request or active `.harness/state.json`.

| Mode | Condition | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Free (default) | No active harness task | Work freely. No contract required. |
| Opt-in | User says `use harness` / `with harness` / `/planner` | Launch skill `adversarial-harness` |
| Resume | `state.json` has `pending`/`building`/`evaluating` task | Continue negotiate → build → `/evaluator` |
| Cancel | User says `skip harness` | Clear marker, return to free mode |

Active harness → need `.harness/contract.json` before impl; do not self-certify.

Full procedure: skill `adversarial-harness`. Design: `docs/HARNESS_ESSENCE.md`.
